{"id":"spn-98497","text":" The gate prints its own total; 148 is what it printed on 2026-08-17, up from 103 in a single session."}]},{"id":"blk-50910","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50912","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98498","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run test:launch"},{"id":"spn-98499","text":" — build then gate. **Set the Cloudflare Pages build"}]}],"id":"blk-50911","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50913","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98500","text":"command to this, never to a plain build**, or an unproven artifact gets served."}]},{"id":"blk-50914","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50916","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98501","text":"The two template SHA-256 values on the page are "},{"id":"spn-98502","marks":["bold"],"text":"not copied"},{"id":"spn-98503","text":" from the record."}]}],"id":"blk-50915","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50917","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98504","text":"They are recomputed from "},{"id":"spn-98505","marks":["code"],"text":"priv/templates/"},{"id":"spn-98506","text":" with "},{"id":"spn-98507","marks":["code"],"text":"compute_template_hash/1"},{"id":"spn-98508","text":"'s own algorithm ("},{"id":"spn-98509","marks":["code"],"text":"lib/agentelic/templates/registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-98510","text":") and the build exits non-zero on a mismatch. That is the site's whole evidence claim."}]},{"id":"blk-50918","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50920","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98511","marks":["bold"],"text":"No `mailto:` anywhere"},{"id":"spn-98512","text":" (Travis's call, 2026-08-11) — the gate refuses one."}]}],"id":"blk-50919","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50921","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98513","marks":["bold"],"text":"Corrections go to a Formspree form"},{"id":"spn-98514","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-98515","marks":["code"],"text":"https://formspree.io/f/xaewoadr"},{"id":"spn-98516","text":", the endpoint "},{"id":"spn-98517","marks":["code"],"text":"computedriven.com"},{"id":"spn-98518","text":" posts to; SHELL.md r9, ruled by Travis 2026-08-17). It is a real "},{"id":"spn-98519","marks":["code"],"text":"<form action method=\"POST\">"},{"id":"spn-98520","text":", so it posts with JavaScript off; "},{"id":"spn-98521","marks":["code"],"text":"/contact.js"},{"id":"spn-98522","text":" only upgrades it to an inline reply and prints \"sent\" "},{"id":"spn-98523","marks":["bold"],"text":"only on an actual 2xx"},{"id":"spn-98524","text":". The gate refuses if the "},{"id":"spn-98525","marks":["code"],"text":"action"},{"id":"spn-98526","text":" is not the endpoint the record declares, or if the "},{"id":"spn-98527","marks":["code"],"text":"_gotcha"},{"id":"spn-98528","text":" honeypot is missing — a honeypot dropped in a refactor fails silently. The issue tracker stays as the second, public route."}]},{"id":"blk-50922","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50924","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98529","text":"**The two gate holes SHELL.md r6 names are closed here, and both were PROVEN"}]}],"id":"blk-50923","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50925","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98530","text":"open first.**"}]},{"id":"blk-50926","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50928","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98531","marks":["italic"],"text":"The retraction blocklist counts now; it used to exempt by class name."}]}],"id":"blk-50927","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-50929","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-98532","text":"Appending the retracted sentence three times to "},{"id":"spn-98533","marks":["code"],"text":"retracted.paragraph"},{"id":"spn-98534","text":" put \"Start building today\" on the artifact "},{"id":"spn-98535","marks":["bold"],"text":"four times"},{"id":"spn-98536","text":" and the gate approved it, 114/0. It now bounds occurrences in both directions: zero outside the retraction, "}